[{"answer":"You know that joint presentation we've got to do this semester, Leo?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/1.mp3"},{"answer":"On houses of the future?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/2.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm a bit concerned...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Are we meant to come up with creative new suggestions for these houses?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't think so.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/6.mp3"},{"answer":"It's more a matter of reporting and evaluating possible developments.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/7.mp3"},{"answer":"But we mustn't be too general,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/8.mp3"},{"answer":"we've got to support our points by referring to specific cases.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/9.mp3"},{"answer":"So that'll need a lot of work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm afraid so.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/11.mp3"},{"answer":"When's it got to be done by?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/12.mp3"},{"answer":"In about 6 weeks, so that's not too much of a rush.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/14.mp3"},{"answer":"We'd better decide now what type of housing we're going to focus on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/15.mp3"},{"answer":"How about housing for different generations living together?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm... we could do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Or accommodation for one person?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/18.mp3"},{"answer":"I think someone else is doing that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/19.mp3"},{"answer":"I was wondering about housing for the elderly?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/20.mp3"},{"answer":"That's likely to become more important.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah that's true.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/22.mp3"},{"answer":"But I think your suggestion about intergenerational living might be more interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's go with that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Now I think the future demand is mainly going to be for accommodation in urban areas.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/26.mp3"},{"answer":"So one way of meeting that demand might be to use existing commercial buildings","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/27.mp3"},{"answer":"and adapt them to form accommodation...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Or come up with original ways of organising space","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/29.mp3"},{"answer":"so that people can live in smaller homes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/30.mp3"},{"answer":"But I think the solution is to design multi-storey apartment blocks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Building up rather than out, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's think of some specific developments for houses of the future.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/34.mp3"},{"answer":"How about increased use of roof space on high-rise buildings for gardens.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/36.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact it doesn't have to be high-rise,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/37.mp3"},{"answer":"you can do it on a one-storey building in a suburb,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/38.mp3"},{"answer":"but it would greatly improve how you feel if you live in an urban high-rise.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Especially if you don't have a balcony.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/41.mp3"},{"answer":"I think homes of the future will all need access to a shared working space,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/42.mp3"},{"answer":"somewhere in the same building or group of houses,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/43.mp3"},{"answer":"where people can go and work instead of just having a laptop on the kitchen table.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, so they aren't having to travel to an office but can still interact with others.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/45.mp3"},{"answer":"That's often how new ideas get generated -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/46.mp3"},{"answer":"by chatting to someone from a different profession.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/48.mp3"},{"answer":"I read about a type of design where the internal walls of an apartment are moveable,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/49.mp3"},{"answer":"so the space can be adapted over time as people's needs change.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Like when children leave school and start working but still continue to live with their parents for many years?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Or when an elderly relative moves in with the family...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/52.mp3"},{"answer":"It would mean they could still have their own space,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/53.mp3"},{"answer":"specially designed for their needs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you heard about those smart bathroom mirrors which can monitor people's health?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/56.mp3"},{"answer":"They recognise signs of illness and contact a doctor automatically?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm, not so sure they're a good idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Nor am I.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/59.mp3"},{"answer":"People might worry about conditions which aren't serious at all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/60.mp3"},{"answer":"What about transport?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Wouldn't it be good if there were bike sheds with charging points,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/62.mp3"},{"answer":"so people could store their electric bikes securely","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/63.mp3"},{"answer":"and charge them up at the same time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/65.mp3"},{"answer":"That would encourage more people to cycle, instead of using their car.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Much better for the planet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/67.mp3"},{"answer":"I read about one housing development where cars had to be left just outside it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/68.mp3"},{"answer":"so the centre was all a pedestrianised area.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Great for families with children.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/71.mp3"},{"answer":"But what if you're disabled or elderly, and can't walk far?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/72.mp3"},{"answer":"It wouldn't be so good for people like that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/73.mp3"},{"answer":"No.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/74.mp3"},{"answer":"I saw a scheme for communal vegetable plots,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/75.mp3"},{"answer":"where neighbours could decide what to grow together.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/76.mp3"},{"answer":"That'd be a great way for older people to get to know one another,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/77.mp3"},{"answer":"especially if they're no longer going out to work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, doing something together's always more enjoyable, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/79.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you think...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-4-part-3-2026-07-19-16-24-17/80.mp3"}]
